Description: APPLICATION_DESCRIPTION
 Grid Viewer opens NetCDF files and OPeNDAP datasets far larger than memory by
 reading only the grid points that fit on screen, and reading more as you zoom.
 Maps, vertical sections and a 3D globe for ocean and climate model outputs.
